gle.com/drive/folders/1peSazqraTcUVvqPRyjGZku9LS-5vEg3R", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakutatsu123/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1460c25c/uploads/origins/422eba27-556e-4767-837b-9640f4ca1429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7933702bab0c3426df0f552c33ad2da5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1460c25c/uploads/origins/422eba27-556e-4767-837b-9640f4ca1429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7933702bab0c3426df0f552c33ad2da5, https://si.imgix.net/1460c25c/uploads/origins/422eba27-556e-4767-837b-9640f4ca1429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50d15e5de01daf10db09042b1cfbda25 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1460c25c/uploads/origins/422eba27-556e-4767-837b-9640f4ca1429?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4e780f1ee512325be1919bdea8786d9 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまた、こんにちは連続でお願いしてすみませんでした。津島さんの絵はとても完成度が高いです今回もボクシング衣装の津島善子を2ポーズと表情でお願いしたいのですが、添付リンクの\n- 参考1」（「ポーズ1」＋「表情1）\n- 参考2」（「ポーズ2」＋「表情2」）。\n- 参考1」の胸の下の露出は含まず、ポーズのみに使用。\n- 参考2」のパンチのぼかしはオプションです。\nどちらも背景なしバージョンでお願いします。\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=1Y9qnMrhs-6jSt2t__zn6dq3Jvpj8iaIF", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakutatsu123/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f98f2be8/uploads/origins/0630a8fd-e48b-436d-a096-0c14e95ebf9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40d8c61606d197dd657a58db1650513d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f98f2be8/uploads/origins/0630a8fd-e48b-436d-a096-0c14e95ebf9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40d8c61606d197dd657a58db1650513d, https://si.imgix.net/f98f2be8/uploads/origins/0630a8fd-e48b-436d-a096-0c14e95ebf9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=259bb0aeba458e68437c90754c484065 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f98f2be8/uploads/origins/0630a8fd-e48b-436d-a096-0c14e95ebf9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97c59f1b5e28380d7bf8f988e9687bf6 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again. I have become big fan of your art! Once again I would like to make a request. This time I wish to ask for drawing of Yoshiko Tsushima in outfit used by Aikyan in 6th Live Windy Stage for \"MeiMei Tantei Yohane\" performance. If possible I would like 2 versions. One of big puffy skirt she wore in beginning of performance and one version of smaller skirt worn at end of performance. Pose and expression I leave to you. If price is too low for request, feel free to appeal. Thank you for considering to accept!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=1lhzmaKKA5p0JUHz9T60uAYTK8kkfj1au", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakutatsu123/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/00f51804/uploads/origins/98a24438-d5c3-446c-ae5a-cfbbb4550cef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a72990130b203a664c7dd1284f45f5c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/00f51804/uploads/origins/98a24438-d5c3-446c-ae5a-cfbbb4550cef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a72990130b203a664c7dd1284f45f5c, https://si.imgix.net/00f51804/uploads/origins/98a24438-d5c3-446c-ae5a-cfbbb4550cef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=68a04aa48527943cec93036b8f5e3b4e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00f51804/uploads/origins/98a24438-d5c3-446c-ae5a-cfbbb4550cef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9a09937e1282458e9b95e2bb2810ccd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは。\nオリジナルキャラクター（https://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/1arJkbKxoXk1DR9Y5NkVBB2GEB7QMOSvR）\nのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n・抱き枕イラスト風の構図（シーツの上に仰向けになって、縦長画面に全身図）で、誘惑してくる\n・①ブカブカYシャツ②全裸の差分あり\n・手首にあるオリジナルのリストバンド（読書が趣味なので付箋がすぐ使えるようにリストバンドに付けているという設定です）は装着した状態、メガネ（アンダーリム、フレーム色赤）は頭付近に外して置いてある\n\n大人なレディーなので、セクシーかつセンシティブに誘惑させてやって頂けると助かります。\n\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakutatsu123/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c70d190a/uploads/origins/95f21805-1de2-40af-abda-f2dc32b3364c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6187566e829ab0dd0795f0ddcdb28c2b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c70d190a/uploads/origins/95f21805-1de2-40af-abda-f2dc32b3364c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6187566e829ab0dd0795f0ddcdb28c2b, https://si.imgix.net/c70d190a/uploads/origins/95f21805-1de2-40af-abda-f2dc32b3364c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=047d749043e4025228e1a4b95f1e6247 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c70d190a/uploads/origins/95f21805-1de2-40af-abda-f2dc32b3364c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40651de84074feaf63064771611fbc60 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!!! I would like to request Yoshiko Tsushima in casual winter wear same as attached link. Pose and expression I leave to you. Thank you for considering to accept\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/folderview?id=1oygYLoE1na1XpOoZDbD8mrCWg5CuTYLp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sakutatsu123/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cf5a13c6/uploads/origins/8d22dc6e-7e47-4c2e-a1f7-bdc1b61d5876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8398f7635c4bfac0b2cf90137c44eb08", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cf5a13c6/uploads/origins/8d22dc6e-7e47-4c2e-a1f7-bdc1b61d5876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8398f7635c4bfac0b2cf90137c44eb08, https://si.imgix.net/cf5a13c6/uploads/origins/8d22dc6e-7e47-4c2e-a1f7-bdc1b61d5876?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f95aa8f7355acdb5ad45404a40ad9b6 2x, https